            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Side A 0.5.12

- No surprise charges: past a plan limit, an account with usage credits on keeps working and bills them. Side A now warns before that happens when no other account has room, tells you when spend goes up, and marks the account "Charging paid credits" in the menu.
- Usage shows each account's paid usage this month against its cap.

macOS 14 or later. Apple Silicon and Intel. Free.
]]></description>
